書勢》","kind":"work","person_id":null,"work_id":"w-jin036-caoshushi","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison:p014:m2579","start":2579,"end":2581,"surface":"頡皇","kind":"person","person_id":"5jw_xvk_zuu","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-wei-comparison","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu036-wei-ws2108231-rendered-comparison"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p006","text":"昔者越王句踐困於會稽之上，乃用范蠡、計然。計然曰：「知斗則修備，時用則知物，二者形則萬貨之情可得而觀已。故歲在金，穰；水，毀；木，饑；火，旱。旱則資舟，水則資車，物之理也。六歲穰，六歲旱，十二歲一大饑。夫糶，二十病農，九十病末。末病則財不出，農病則草不辟矣。上不過八十，下不減三十，則農末俱利，平糶齊物，關市不乏，治國之道也。積著之理，務完物，無息幣。以物相貿易，腐敗而食之貨勿留，無敢居貴。論其有餘不足，則知貴賤。貴上極則反賤，賤下極則反貴。貴出如糞土，賤取如珠玉。財幣欲其行如流水。」修之十年，國富，厚賂戰士，士赴矢石，如渴得飲，遂報彊吳，觀兵中國，稱號「五霸」。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m006-0002","start":2,"end":6,"surface":"越王句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"h1w_1k2_zgz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m006-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"范蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m006-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"計然","kind":"person","person_id":"mge_pi9_fn1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m006-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"計然","kind":"person","person_id":"mge_pi9_fn1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi","book_id":"b-shiji-129","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji129-huozhi"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p007","text":"范蠡既雪會稽之恥，乃喟然而嘆曰：「計然之策七，越用其五而得意。既已施於國，吾欲用之家。」乃乘扁舟浮於江湖，變名易姓，適齊為鴟夷子皮，之陶為朱公。朱公以為陶天下之中，諸侯四通，貨物所交易也。乃治產積居。與時逐而不責於人。故善治生者，能擇人而任時。十九年之中三致千金，再分散與貧交疏昆弟。此所謂富好行其德者也。後年衰老而聽子孫，子孫修業而息之，遂至巨萬。故言富者皆稱陶朱公。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"范蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"計然","kind":"person","person_id":"mge_pi9_fn1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0061","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"鴟夷子皮","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0138","start":138,"end":141,"surface":"疏昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m007-0181","start":181,"end":184,"surface":"陶朱公","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi","book_id":"b-shiji-129","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji129-huozhi"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:p043","text":"貨殖之利，工商是營。廢居善積，倚巿邪贏。白圭富國，計然強兵。倮參朝請，女築懷清。素封千戶，卓鄭齊名。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m043-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"白圭","kind":"person","person_id":"evw_7hk_sqo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m043-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"計然","kind":"person","person_id":"mge_pi9_fn1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m043-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"倮","kind":"person","person_id":"vlm_env_ap8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-129-huozhi:m043-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id